  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 400\t10F (200\t15C). ",
    "In a large bowl, mix together the sweet potatoes and 2 tablespoons of sugar. ",
    "Bake the sweet potatoes in the oven for 20 minutes, or until tender. ",
    "While the sweet potatoes are baking, melt the candy melts in a double boiler. ",
    "Coat the pecans in the melted candy and bake for an additional 5-7 minutes, or until caramelized. ",
    "Mix together the rosemary sprigs and black sesame seeds. ",
    "Bake the rosemary sprigs in the oven for an additional 2-3 minutes, or until fragrant. ",
    "To assemble the dish, place the sweet potatoes in the dolsot stone bowl and top with the pecans and rosemary sprigs. "
